* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_tsoff_rint (reference/crafted.toml, 19 Nov 2026): demo12_tsoff (dynamic
* timeslice trees, TS_OFF with %DYNTS% YES) plus a vintaged process at the ANNUAL level with ANNUAL data, so
* that dynslite.vda POSTLEV re-interpolates it over the vintages (L91-103; M1.3 change 68), which no open model
* reaches: CSHNGAS1 in REG1 (commercial space heating, gas; ANNUAL) becomes vintaged, and its efficiency
* ACT_EFF at ANNUAL, 0.93 in 2005 in demo12, rises to 0.97 for the 2030 vintage.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET PRC_VINT
/
REG1.CSHNGAS1
/

PARAMETER ACT_EFF /
REG1.2030.CSHNGAS1.ACT.ANNUAL 0.97
/;
